          <div class="hero-actions">
            <button class="button primary" type="button" id="todayAction">Start today’s task</button>
            <button class="button secondary" type="button" id="smartReviewAction">Smart review</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="countdown-card" aria-label="Exam countdown">
          <span class="countdown-number" id="daysToExam">—</span>
          <span class="countdown-label">days to exam</span>
          <span class="countdown-date">7 November 2026</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="notice syllabus-notice" role="note">
        <div class="notice-icon" aria-hidden="true">!</div>
        <div>
          <strong>Confirm your exam version.</strong>
          The 7 November date appears on the regular 2026 HSK calendar, while HSK 3.0 was announced separately as a 20 September trial. This app uses the classic 600-word syllabus from your PDF. Confirm with your test centre before relying on this deck alone.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stat-grid" aria-label="Study progress">
        <article class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-label">In review</span>
          <strong class="stat-value" id="statLearned">0</strong>
          <span class="stat-detail" id="statLearnedDetail">of 600 introduced</span>
        </article>
        <article class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-label">Due now</span>
          <strong class="stat-value" id="statDue">0</strong>
          <span class="stat-detail">review cards</span>
        </article>
        <article class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-label">Weak words</span>
          <strong class="stat-value" id="statWeak">0</strong>
          <span class="stat-detail">need extra attention</span>
        </article>
        <article class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-label">Today</span>
          <strong class="stat-value" id="statToday">0</strong>
          <span class="stat-detail">answers recorded</span>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">CHOOSE A SESSION</p>
          <h2>Study with a clear purpose</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mode-grid">
        <article class="mode-card featured">
          <span class="mode-kicker">Recommended</span>
          <h3>Smart review</h3>
          <p>Overdue cards first, then weak cards and a small random sample.</p>
          <button class="text-button" type="button" data-start-mode="smart">Review due cards <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
        </article>
        <article class="mode-card">
          <span class="mode-kicker">Shuffled set</span>
          <h3>Random practice</h3>
          <p>Start with one copy of each selected word; missed cards return once.</p>
          <button class="text-button" type="button" data-start-mode="random">Start random cards <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
        </article>
        <article class="mode-card">
          <span class="mode-kicker">Daily batch</span>
          <h3>Learn new words</h3>
          <p>Work through the next unlearned words in your 600-card deck.</p>
          <button class="text-button" type="button" data-start-mode="learn">Open next batch <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
        </article>
      </div>

      <section class="progress-panel" aria-labelledby="masteryTitle">
        <div class="panel-title-row">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">DECK PROGRESS</p>
            <h2 id="masteryTitle">Coverage at a glance</h2>
          </div>
          <span id="masteryPercent" class="progress-percent">0%</span>
        </div>
        <div class="progress-track" aria-hidden="true"><span id="masteryBar"></span></div>
        <div class="progress-legend">
          <span><i class="legend-dot learned"></i><b id="legendLearned">0</b> in review</span>
          <span><i class="legend-dot new"></i><b id="legendNew">600</b> remaining</span>
          <span><i class="legend-dot strong"></i><b id="legendStrong">0</b> strong</span>
        </div>
      </section>
    </section>

    <section class="view" id="view-review" data-view="review" aria-labelledby="reviewTitle">
      <div id="sessionSetup" class="study-setup">
        <p class="eyebrow">STUDY</p>
        <h1 id="reviewTitle">Choose how you want to practise</h1>
        <p class="lead">Meaning is self-graded so synonyms do not count against you.</p>

        <div class="setup-grid">
          <label class="field-label">Session type
            <select id="sessionMode">
              <option value="smart">Smart review</option>
              <option value="random">Random review pool</option>
              <option value="learn">Next new words</option>
              <option value="diagnostic">Diagnostic sample</option>
              <option value="mistakes">Mistakes from last session</option>
            </select>
          </label>
          <label class="field-label">Prompt direction
            <select id="sessionDirection">
              <option value="mixed">Mixed</option>
              <option value="hanzi">Hanzi → meaning</option>
              <option value="meaning">Meaning → Hanzi</option>
            </select>
          </label>
          <label class="field-label">Cards
            <select id="sessionSize">
              <option value="10">10</option>
              <option value="20" selected>20</option>
              <option value="30">30</option>
              <option value="60">60</option>
              <option value="100">100</option>
              <option value="all">All available</option>
            </select>
          </label>
        </div>
        <button class="button primary large" type="button" id="startConfiguredSession">Start session</button>
        <div class="keyboard-note">During a card: <kbd>Enter</kbd> reveal while typing · <kbd>Space</kbd> reveal outside the text box · <kbd>1</kbd>–<kbd>4</kbd> rate</div>
      </div>

      <div id="sessionActive" class="session-area" hidden>
        <div class="session-topbar">
          <div>
            <span class="session-mode-label" id="activeModeLabel">Smart review</span>
            <strong id="sessionProgressText" aria-live="polite">Card 1 of 20</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="session-top-actions">
            <button class="button ghost small" type="button" id="endSessionButton">End session</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="session-progress-track" aria-hidden="true"><span id="sessionProgressBar"></span></div>

        <article class="flashcard" id="flashcard">
          <div class="card-meta-row">
            <span class="card-number" id="cardNumber">Word 1</span>
            <span class="direction-chip" id="directionChip">Hanzi → meaning</span>
          </div>
          <div class="prompt-label" id="promptLabel">What does this mean?</div>
          <div class="card-prompt hanzi" id="cardPrompt" lang="zh-Hans" aria-live="polite">你好</div>

          <label class="guess-label" for="guessInput">Your guess <span>(optional)</span></label>
          <input id="guessInput" class="guess-input" type="text" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Type what you remember…">

          <div class="answer-panel" id="answerPanel" aria-live="polite" hidden>
            <div class="answer-hanzi" id="answerHanzi" lang="zh-Hans">你好</div>
            <div class="answer-pinyin" id="answerPinyin">nǐhǎo</div>
            <div class="answer-meaning" id="answerMeaning">hello</div>
            <button class="speak-button" id="speakButton" type="button" aria-label="Hear Chinese pronunciation"><span aria-hidden="true">◖)))</span> Hear word</button>
          </div>

          <button class="button primary reveal-button" type="button" id="revealButton">Reveal answer <span class="shortcut">Space</span></button>
          <div class="rating-grid" id="ratingButtons" hidden>
            <button class="rating again" type="button" data-rating="again"><span>Again</span><small>1 · incorrect</small></button>
            <button class="rating hard" type="button" data-rating="hard"><span>Hard</span><small>2 · partly right</small></button>
            <button class="rating good" type="button" data-rating="good"><span>Good</span><small>3 · correct</small></button>
            <button class="rating easy" type="button" data-rating="easy"><span>Easy</span><small>4 · instant</small></button>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div id="sessionSummary" class="summary-card" hidden>
        <div class="summary-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</div>
        <p class="eyebrow">SESSION COMPLETE</p>
        <h1>Good work—review the evidence.</h1>
        <div class="summary-stats">
          <div><strong id="summaryReviewed">0</strong><span>unique words</span></div>
          <div><strong id="summaryAccuracy">0%</strong><span>good or easy</span></div>
          <div><strong id="summaryMinutes">0</strong><span>minutes</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="mistake-list-wrap" id="mistakeListWrap" hidden>
          <h2>Words to revisit</h2>
          <div class="mistake-list" id="mistakeList"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="summary-actions">
          <button class="button primary" type="button" id="reviewMistakesButton">Review mistakes</button>
          <button class="button secondary" type="button" id="returnDashboardButton">Return to dashboard</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="view" id="view-writing" data-view="writing" aria-labelledby="writingTitle">
      <div class="section-heading align-end">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">HANDWRITING PRACTICE</p>
          <h1 id="writingTitle">Write one character at a time</h1>
          <p class="lead">Trace the guide with your finger or Apple Pencil, then hide it and write from memory.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="writing-quick-actions">
          <button class="button secondary" type="button" id="writingWeakButton">Practise a weak word</button>
          <button class="button secondary" type="button" id="writingRandomButton">Random word</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="writing-picker-grid">
        <label class="field-label">Find a word
          <input id="writingWordSearch" type="search" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Hanzi, pinyin, or meaning…">
